### GET request to example server


### Get Request to server
### Get all Books
GET http://localhost:3333/books
### Get 1 Book
GET http://localhost:3333/books/2

# POST -> Insert new Book
### (this is a request seperator)
POST http://localhost:3333/books
Content-type: application/json

{
  "title": "Educated Part 2",
  "author": "Tara Westover",
  "cost": 100.59,
  "desc": "The continuing story"
}

